    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d222-a2">

                <pb facs="0439" n="1093" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg1093"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    211.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Castro to Mr.
                            Cushing.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ministry of
                            State</hi>,<lb/><placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#italic">The
                                Palace</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-01-06"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 6, 1875</date>.
                        (Received January 7.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to address
                    myself to your excellency with the object of stating to you that yesterday I
                    took charge of the ministry of state, to which I was appointed by decree of
                    December 31, ultimo.</p>
                <p>In bringing this to your knowledge, I improve the occasion to offer to your
                    excellency the assurances of my most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed>ALEJANDRO CASTRO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister Plenipotentiary of the United
                            States.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
